  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0b/Northern_Pike.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711150944\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Northern pike\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Northern pike\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"139\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Northern pike</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lure(s) </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Lure</span><span title=\"Green lure\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lure\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Green_Lure.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/29?cb=20140330225800\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> <span>Lure</span><span title=\"Gold lure\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lure\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a8/Gold_Lure.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/29?cb=20140330230009\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spot(s): </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">any</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Circle(s): </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">large</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 14</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Northern pikes</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>.\n</p><p>Like all types of fish, each northern pike gives one <a href=\"/wiki/fish-fillet-18999\" title=\"Fish Fillet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish fillet</a> when caught.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Catching northern pikes</b></span></h3>\n<p>Northern pikes can be caught with green and gold <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a> in any fishing spot, but their favorite spot is #8 (the rocky area near the fishing boat).\n</p><p>Northern pikes can be caught in large circles and therefore are easier to catch.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/60/FishingMap_Names.png/revision/latest?cb=20180725200602\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"FishingMap Names\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"350\" height=\"231\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<p>See <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-list-25399\" title=\"Fishing List\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing List</a> for more detailed information.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Northern pikes in the fishing book</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/24/Northern_Pike_Photo.png/revision/latest?cb=20130624123809\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fishing book photo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fishing book photo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"174\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Fishing book photo</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The northern pike is on page 9 of the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-book-17693\" title=\"Fishing Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing book</a>:\n</p><p><i>Always on the tail of other fish! They'd appreciate it if you took the pike for a breather.</i>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>See also</b></span></h3>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/arctic-charr-11443\" title=\"Arctic Charr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Arctic Charr\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/asp-10866\" title=\"Asp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Asp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bitterling-10865\" title=\"Bitterling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bitterling\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/black-bullhead-11455\" title=\"Black Bullhead\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black Bullhead\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bluespotted-sunfish-10864\" title=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bluegill-10654\" title=\"Bluegill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bluegill\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/brook-trout-11444\" title=\"Brook Trout\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Brook Trout\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/carp-11437\" title=\"Carp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/coho-salmon-10639\" title=\"Coho Salmon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coho Salmon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"86\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/copper-redhorse-10101\" title=\"Copper Redhorse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Copper Redhorse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"8